To answer your first question; I wear free action permanently (if I
have it), and - depending on the actual state - other choices are
(in no particular order), warning(!), regeneration, gain constitution,
increase damage, slow digestion, polymorph control (if lacking MR),
teleport control (if choosen to have teleportitis, but no intrinsic
control), even invisibility or any of the basic ring resistances if I
do not yet have them.

Conflict is rather one of the "occasional" choices for me; comparable
to levitation, put it on if you are in need that the monsters have to
fight each other because you cannot handle them yourself. And,
naturally, especially if I make heavy use of pets I restrict myself
from conflict.

